WEBVTT

00:00:19.410 --> 00:00:22.330
I can't eat anymore...

00:00:33.500 --> 00:00:36.950
Hey, you want some, come on...

00:00:41.160 --> 00:00:43.580
I'm getting moist...

00:00:48.370 --> 00:00:51.410
Not scared...

00:02:44.250 --> 00:02:49.250
Ugh, they got me good, those mosquitoes.

00:02:49.250 --> 00:02:55.160
How stupid are you? Who would
sleep outside, just because it's hot?

00:02:57.790 --> 00:03:02.040
Well, speaking of sleeping habits,
what's the mark on your face?

00:03:03.330 --> 00:03:04.580
Mark?

00:03:05.450 --> 00:03:08.080
Th-This is nothing!

00:03:08.080 --> 00:03:12.450
Suspicious... Were you sleeping
on the roof again?

00:03:12.450 --> 00:03:16.700
I don't do that anymore!
I'm not a baby like you are!

00:03:17.950 --> 00:03:19.660
Hey! I'm just stating facts here!

00:03:19.660 --> 00:03:21.330
Facts from when?!

00:03:24.370 --> 00:03:28.160
Yes, yes. Enough, both of you.

00:03:28.160 --> 00:03:31.000
Don't fight first thing in the morning!

00:03:34.120 --> 00:03:35.700
Where's Shigure-<i>chan</i>?

00:03:35.700 --> 00:03:38.830
Hmm? Weird, she's not here.

00:03:38.830 --> 00:03:42.080
Shigure, oversleeping? That's strange.

00:03:42.080 --> 00:03:46.160
She said she was going to cook
breakfast this morning.

00:03:46.160 --> 00:03:52.870
Shigure-<i>sama</i>'s miso soup and fish dishes
are excellent! I can't wait!

00:03:52.870 --> 00:03:55.250
Is there anything else ever on your mind...?

00:03:56.750 --> 00:03:58.250
Hey, Shigure--

00:03:59.830 --> 00:04:03.250
Good morning, everyone...

00:04:05.540 --> 00:04:07.660
Shigure-<i>sama</i>! Breakfast...?

00:04:13.160 --> 00:04:15.870
What's up with Shigure-<i>chan</i>?

00:04:15.870 --> 00:04:18.200
It's not like her to be so unenergetic...

00:04:21.200 --> 00:04:23.250
Th-This is...

00:04:25.540 --> 00:04:28.370
A beautiful block of charcoal.

00:04:32.540 --> 00:04:35.620
But Shigure-<i>sama</i>'s miso soup is the best!

00:04:35.620 --> 00:04:37.370
Let's eat!

00:04:40.040 --> 00:04:42.080
Are you okay, Nuts?!

00:04:42.950 --> 00:04:45.660
What is this? It's way too salty...

00:04:48.700 --> 00:04:51.160
Too much miso I guess...

00:04:51.160 --> 00:04:55.000
Maplez is just oversensitive, though.

00:04:55.000 --> 00:04:56.450
Shut up...

00:04:56.450 --> 00:05:01.370
What's up with Shigure today?
Is something wrong?

00:05:06.620 --> 00:05:09.870
Wasn't Shigure-<i>chan </i>a bit weird earlier?

00:05:09.870 --> 00:05:13.830
Yeah, she wouldn't respond
when talked to--just spaced out.

00:05:13.830 --> 00:05:16.700
It could be the heat.

00:05:16.700 --> 00:05:21.660
Right... It could be summer heat fatigue.

00:05:21.660 --> 00:05:27.830
Yeah. In addition to housework, she's also
working on advertising Kashou-<i>san</i>'s shop.

00:05:27.830 --> 00:05:30.250
She might be a bit tired.

00:05:30.250 --> 00:05:36.700
I know! How about we help her
and bring her back her energy?

00:05:36.700 --> 00:05:39.160
Sounds good! I agree!

00:05:39.160 --> 00:05:41.290
Me, too!

00:05:41.290 --> 00:05:43.160
Fine, fine...

00:05:43.160 --> 00:05:45.040
I guess I have to join!

00:05:57.830 --> 00:06:00.500
W-We haven't done this
type of thing in a while!

00:06:00.500 --> 00:06:03.160
Y-Yeah, I know!

00:06:11.250 --> 00:06:15.410
Shigure-<i>chan</i>! My tail! My tail!

00:06:15.410 --> 00:06:18.950
Shigure-<i>chan</i>! You're sucking in my tail!

00:06:22.080 --> 00:06:26.370
Shigure! Come on!
This is bad! Pull out, pull out!

00:06:27.620 --> 00:06:29.330
Huh? What?

00:06:30.370 --> 00:06:34.700
The powerful pull of the vacuum and
May-<i>chan</i>'s grabbing combines to make

00:06:34.700 --> 00:06:37.410
a strangely comfortable force...

00:06:37.410 --> 00:06:39.790
N-No...

00:06:39.790 --> 00:06:45.040
Oh, I'm getting moist!

00:06:46.000 --> 00:06:48.500
Why are you...?

00:06:48.500 --> 00:06:51.040
This is no time to get moist!

00:06:54.790 --> 00:06:58.330
Shigure-<i>sama</i>? Should we be
hanging these clothes out here?

00:06:59.410 --> 00:07:00.750
Shigure-<i>sama</i>?

00:07:01.910 --> 00:07:04.750
Hmm? What are these panties?

00:07:05.660 --> 00:07:09.870
Not even Chocola and Vanilla
would wear childish underwear like these!

00:07:09.870 --> 00:07:12.160
Did Cacao leave these behind?

00:07:13.500 --> 00:07:16.540
Look at these kid panties, Azuki!

00:07:16.540 --> 00:07:19.450
Shut up! There's nothing wrong
with those panties!

00:07:19.450 --> 00:07:21.790
What was that about?

00:07:21.790 --> 00:07:25.250
Wait, so are these...?

00:07:25.250 --> 00:07:29.750
I-I'm an adult lady! I don't wear those!

00:07:29.750 --> 00:07:31.000
Are you sure?

00:07:31.000 --> 00:07:33.200
Just hang them up already!

00:07:37.000 --> 00:07:39.160
Why only panties...?

00:07:42.870 --> 00:07:44.870
Looks like our plan failed.

00:07:44.870 --> 00:07:47.580
Maybe it isn't the heat?

00:07:47.580 --> 00:07:51.750
I just want her to be her usual self...

00:07:51.750 --> 00:07:56.750
Usual, though? I mean, usually, she's...

00:07:59.660 --> 00:08:03.040
Excellent angle! Excellent angle indeed!

00:08:04.950 --> 00:08:09.910
Don't mind if I do! Don't mind if I do!

00:08:11.580 --> 00:08:14.830
Shigure-<i>chan </i>can be quite aggressive
first thing in the morning...

00:08:14.830 --> 00:08:17.700
Stop getting moist over a memory!

00:08:17.700 --> 00:08:21.540
Isn't she fine the way she is?
It's less annoying.

00:08:21.540 --> 00:08:23.450
No, it's not fine!

00:08:23.450 --> 00:08:28.040
There's got to be something we can do
to get Shigure-<i>sama </i>back into shape!

00:08:31.330 --> 00:08:33.040
I'm home...

00:08:33.040 --> 00:08:34.910
Welcome home!

00:08:35.910 --> 00:08:37.700
E-Everyone...?

00:08:42.290 --> 00:08:43.540
Is this...?

00:08:43.540 --> 00:08:45.870
Come on! Sit, sit.

00:08:48.120 --> 00:08:52.790
Would you like some
sweet honey toast? It's my favorite.

00:08:52.790 --> 00:08:56.580
Boiled mackerel, made from
fresh fish bought at the local store!

00:08:56.580 --> 00:08:58.660
I made tuna sashimi, too!

00:08:59.750 --> 00:09:01.910
I worked real hard!

00:09:01.910 --> 00:09:02.950
Oh...

00:09:02.950 --> 00:09:04.870
And from me...

00:09:04.870 --> 00:09:10.910
A generous serving of high-class dried
bonito shavings from Makurazaki on tofu!

00:09:10.910 --> 00:09:16.450
I had it saved up for a special occasion,
but it's all yours now! Go for it!

00:09:17.370 --> 00:09:20.000
Thank you...

00:09:20.000 --> 00:09:24.080
...but I'm just not hungry right now.

00:09:24.080 --> 00:09:25.120
Huh?

00:09:26.450 --> 00:09:28.250
I'm sorry...

00:09:30.250 --> 00:09:33.750
Please enjoy amongst yourselves.

00:09:41.700 --> 00:09:44.620
I'm seriously worried about Shigure-<i>sama</i>.

00:09:44.620 --> 00:09:47.500
It doesn't seem like it
affected your appetite, though!

00:09:47.500 --> 00:09:52.870
So I guess we still haven't
figured out why she's so lethargic.

00:09:52.870 --> 00:09:56.540
Maybe she's suffering from lack of Kashou?

00:09:56.540 --> 00:10:00.700
It's true, she does love
her brother a bit too much.

00:10:03.330 --> 00:10:06.750
Oh, staring at my brother's photo
is so wonderful!

00:10:13.580 --> 00:10:15.910
Welcome home, Brother!

00:10:15.910 --> 00:10:20.830
Dinner first? Bath first? Or...

00:10:20.830 --> 00:10:23.370
...your sister first?

00:10:26.330 --> 00:10:31.790
Dear brother! Let me wash you
in hard-to-reach places!

00:10:36.080 --> 00:10:41.700
So cold, dear brother! My love is
deeper than the Mariana Trench!

00:10:44.790 --> 00:10:48.080
It seems a bit twisted though...

00:10:48.080 --> 00:10:53.500
Kashou-<i>san </i>did stop coming back
here after he started his shop.

00:10:53.500 --> 00:10:58.870
Right. It must be her lack of
Kashou that is bothering her!

00:10:58.870 --> 00:11:01.950
--I see.
--That's possible.

00:11:03.750 --> 00:11:06.870
So then, what do we do?

00:11:06.870 --> 00:11:10.660
We can just set it up
so she can spend time with him!

00:11:12.200 --> 00:11:13.830
It's settled, then.

00:11:13.830 --> 00:11:15.540
Yeah!

00:11:29.910 --> 00:11:34.000
Wh-Why am I dressed like this...?

00:11:34.000 --> 00:11:38.450
The cats back home told us you
seem to need energy!

00:11:38.450 --> 00:11:42.830
No better solution to that
than wearing a cute outfit.

00:11:42.830 --> 00:11:49.410
Yes, by helping out here, you'll forget
whatever was bothering you!

00:11:49.410 --> 00:11:53.540
B-But me dressed up like this won't...

00:11:53.540 --> 00:11:59.290
Don't worry. Wear these cat ears--
you'll look just like a cat.

00:11:59.290 --> 00:12:00.410
Here you are.

00:12:06.790 --> 00:12:08.750
So cute...

00:12:15.120 --> 00:12:17.200
W-Welcome!

00:12:20.120 --> 00:12:25.160
W-Would you like this seat... meow?

00:12:27.290 --> 00:12:30.450
Th-Thank you for waiting-- Meow!

00:12:36.160 --> 00:12:37.790
How is Shigure doing?

00:12:38.830 --> 00:12:40.750
Is she working properly?

00:12:40.750 --> 00:12:42.700
How, you ask...

00:12:42.700 --> 00:12:44.750
See for yourself.

00:12:45.410 --> 00:12:47.660
I knew it...

00:12:47.660 --> 00:12:52.290
I am a shut-in by nature,
so serving customers is not for me...

00:12:55.620 --> 00:12:58.040
Seems to have the reverse effect.

00:12:59.370 --> 00:13:03.410
What can we do to make her feel better?

00:13:03.410 --> 00:13:08.450
I suppose it is time for me to buy
some vanilla ice cream for her.

00:13:08.450 --> 00:13:11.540
What? Red bean bar is better.

00:13:11.540 --> 00:13:14.250
What are you talking about?
Coconut bar is the best.

00:13:14.250 --> 00:13:17.540
What, you want some?
Red bean bar is really hard.

00:13:17.540 --> 00:13:21.700
--That's not the only
desired quality in ice cream!
--Think about what Shigure wants,
not what you yourselves want!

00:13:21.700 --> 00:13:24.040
What are you all gathered around for?

00:13:25.080 --> 00:13:26.500
Kashou!

00:13:26.500 --> 00:13:29.330
Is it something about Shigure?

00:13:29.330 --> 00:13:33.000
I guess we have to ask Kashou now!

00:13:33.000 --> 00:13:34.250
Yes!

00:13:36.370 --> 00:13:39.410
Please save Shigure-<i>chan</i>!

00:13:39.410 --> 00:13:40.870
Please!

00:13:43.620 --> 00:13:45.870
Thank you, Cacao-<i>chan</i>!

00:13:45.870 --> 00:13:48.870
Good job shopping on your own, Chiyo.

00:13:48.870 --> 00:13:51.950
You're doing great helping your shop, too!

00:13:51.950 --> 00:13:53.700
See you!

00:14:03.250 --> 00:14:05.750
Wow! Nice scent!

00:14:05.750 --> 00:14:07.250
Herbal tea?

00:14:07.250 --> 00:14:12.410
Yes, it's chamomile.
It has a relaxing, calming effect.

00:14:12.410 --> 00:14:17.080
I brought <i>macha </i>green tea
roll cake, Shigure's favorite.

00:14:17.080 --> 00:14:21.540
We will stay away so you can
spend some alone time with her.

00:14:21.540 --> 00:14:25.080
Console her moistly.

00:14:25.080 --> 00:14:27.120
What does that even mean...?

00:14:27.120 --> 00:14:30.250
Anyway, is this really such a big deal?

00:14:30.250 --> 00:14:35.910
It is. You're away most of the time,
so you have to spoil your little sister.

00:14:35.910 --> 00:14:44.160
Y-Yeah, I guess I do talk to Shigure
a lot less after moving out.

00:14:44.160 --> 00:14:46.910
Shigure-<i>sama </i>would be so happy!

00:14:46.910 --> 00:14:48.290
Yes, yes.

00:14:57.950 --> 00:15:01.950
I'm sorry I caused so much concern.

00:15:01.950 --> 00:15:06.830
If it's okay, can you tell me why
you're feeling so lethargic?

00:15:10.410 --> 00:15:14.330
I can't really say for sure, unfortunately.

00:15:14.330 --> 00:15:18.290
I just have this gloomy feeling all the time...

00:15:18.290 --> 00:15:19.790
Could it be...?

00:15:20.370 --> 00:15:23.250
It's not your fault.

00:15:23.250 --> 00:15:27.000
You moved out of the house
to make your dream come true.

00:15:27.000 --> 00:15:31.290
I have nothing but
the fullest support for this.

00:15:31.290 --> 00:15:33.330
Shigure...

00:15:33.330 --> 00:15:39.080
My wish is to see La Soleil succeed.

00:15:39.080 --> 00:15:43.700
I will do everything in my power and more
to make sure that happens.

00:15:45.120 --> 00:15:46.830
What a beautiful story...

00:15:46.830 --> 00:15:48.200
Shigure-<i>sama</i>...

00:15:48.200 --> 00:15:50.040
She's so admirable.

00:15:50.040 --> 00:15:54.830
Sibling love... That's a great thing, too.

00:15:55.790 --> 00:16:01.250
I will take my leave now.
Thank you for treating me today.

00:16:01.250 --> 00:16:03.790
Come back anytime.

00:16:03.790 --> 00:16:05.450
Yes...

00:16:05.450 --> 00:16:07.910
Happily ever after.

00:16:07.910 --> 00:16:10.250
She's going to keep the ears on...?

00:16:13.410 --> 00:16:15.500
Hmm...

00:16:15.500 --> 00:16:17.370
What's wrong, Azuki?

00:16:17.370 --> 00:16:23.790
Shigure does look like she got better,
but she still seems a bit off, don't you think?

00:16:23.790 --> 00:16:27.000
Like she's not aware of her surroundings.

00:16:27.000 --> 00:16:30.750
Is Shigure-<i>chan </i>okay...?

00:16:44.830 --> 00:16:47.950
So now we're stalking her
out of concern, but...

00:16:47.950 --> 00:16:50.330
This isn't the way home.

00:16:50.330 --> 00:16:51.540
Yeah...

00:17:03.450 --> 00:17:05.040
Shigure-<i>chan</i>...

00:17:05.830 --> 00:17:08.120
"Fresh Fish Restaurant
Shirasu"
"Enjoy fresh whitebait"

00:17:12.000 --> 00:17:14.040
Where is she going off to...?

00:17:29.950 --> 00:17:34.910
Hey, this is really bad! Why would she
come out here instead of going home?

00:17:34.910 --> 00:17:38.660
I thought she was finally feeling better...

00:17:38.660 --> 00:17:41.290
What is she doing?

00:17:46.540 --> 00:17:48.160
It's kind of scary out here...

00:17:57.830 --> 00:17:59.410
Could this be...

00:17:59.410 --> 00:18:02.370
I've seen this in a TV drama before!

00:18:02.370 --> 00:18:07.040
A person who lost her love,
jumping off a cliff in despair!

00:18:07.040 --> 00:18:08.580
What?!

00:18:08.580 --> 00:18:13.040
Shigure-<i>chan </i>must be in grief over her
unrequited immoral love to her brother

00:18:13.040 --> 00:18:16.330
and wants to jump off the cliff!

00:18:16.330 --> 00:18:19.040
That can't be right...

00:18:19.040 --> 00:18:20.540
It's too far-fetched...

00:18:20.540 --> 00:18:22.830
Yeah. That's way too...

00:18:24.830 --> 00:18:27.160
No, Shigure-<i>chan</i>!

00:18:27.160 --> 00:18:29.500
--Sh-Shigure-<i>sama</i>!
--Shigure!

00:18:29.500 --> 00:18:33.120
Dammit... Shigure!

00:18:33.950 --> 00:18:38.000
--Shigure!
--Shigure!
--Shigure-<i>sama</i>!

00:18:39.580 --> 00:18:41.080
No, Shigure!

00:18:41.080 --> 00:18:42.950
Don't die!

00:18:42.950 --> 00:18:45.000
Shigure!

00:18:45.000 --> 00:18:46.410
Why are you all here...?

00:18:46.410 --> 00:18:50.870
Idiot! We're all worried about you!

00:18:50.870 --> 00:18:52.540
Yes!

00:18:52.540 --> 00:18:59.000
Shigure-<i>chan</i>, every day, you take such delight
in taking so many photos of us.

00:18:59.000 --> 00:19:04.040
You treasure the photos
you put up on your blog.

00:19:04.040 --> 00:19:09.250
You've taken such great care of me
since I was very small.

00:19:09.250 --> 00:19:17.370
You're so kind, caring,
and work so hard to take care of us...

00:19:17.370 --> 00:19:19.250
We all...

00:19:19.250 --> 00:19:21.200
...love you so much for that!

00:19:32.410 --> 00:19:33.700
Huh?

00:19:39.750 --> 00:19:41.330
Wh-What...?

00:19:41.330 --> 00:19:42.580
Shigure...?

00:19:44.620 --> 00:19:46.870
Shigure-<i>sama</i>... What's gotten into her?!

00:19:46.870 --> 00:19:49.500
This is seriously messed up!

00:19:49.500 --> 00:19:53.290
I don't mind if I do! I don't mind if I do!

00:19:53.290 --> 00:19:56.330
I don't mind if I do!

00:20:03.450 --> 00:20:04.580
Azuki!

00:20:06.540 --> 00:20:07.750
No!

00:20:18.620 --> 00:20:22.450
I've figured out why I was feeling so down.

00:20:22.450 --> 00:20:23.830
Huh?

00:20:23.830 --> 00:20:30.370
I noticed when you all hugged me.
The cause is the heat.

00:20:30.370 --> 00:20:35.290
During the winter, you all came
to snuggle with me while we slept.

00:20:35.290 --> 00:20:39.950
However, recently, because of
the heat, you stopped coming,

00:20:39.950 --> 00:20:43.160
to find a cooler place to sleep.

00:20:43.160 --> 00:20:48.200
That's why I was deprived.
I was suffering from acute cat deprivation,

00:20:48.200 --> 00:20:52.750
and that was drying up my heart!

00:20:52.750 --> 00:20:55.500
Wh-What?!

00:20:55.500 --> 00:21:00.830
That cliff is the place I often go
to dwell on my concerns, but...

00:21:00.830 --> 00:21:05.790
You all followed me out of concern.

00:21:05.790 --> 00:21:08.040
Thank you very much.

00:21:09.790 --> 00:21:13.410
Come on, Shigure. Don't be so polite.

00:21:14.370 --> 00:21:17.370
Don't hold back those things.

00:21:17.370 --> 00:21:19.830
Yeah, just tell us.

00:21:19.830 --> 00:21:22.330
I guess I can join, just for tonight.

00:21:22.330 --> 00:21:24.540
Let's all get moist together!

00:21:42.620 --> 00:21:45.410
I don't mind if I do...

00:23:16.910 --> 00:23:21.830
"Illustration by Hiten"
"Please watch again!"
